:: Chalets Work End Angry
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<if ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "shy"))>>
	"Please," you say, breathless. "This is horrible. Let me down."
<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "docile") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant"))>>
	"Could you put me down, please?" you say. "I've had enough of this."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Put me down," you say. "Now."
<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel"))>>
	"Put me down this instant," you snap.
<<else>>
