:: Chalets Work End Wiggle
<<effects>>
You give your <<bottom>> an exaggerated wiggle, playing to the camera for all of a second. The <<person1>><<person>> rewards you with a sharp smack.
<br><br>
"Did you get that?" the <<person2>><<person>> asks, shifting in <<his>> seat to check the camera's rear screen. 
<br><br>
The <<person1>><<person>> slows <<his>> steed to drop you into the sand.
<br><br>
They ride off soon after, leaving you to pick yourself up and walk the rest of the way to shore.
<br><br>
<<chalets_end_link>>

